OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fmainly dry evening and overnight
OL,7,Fperiod with some sunny then clear
OL,8,Fspells, just the chance of the odd
OL,9,Flight shower for Argyll.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA mainly dry, bright day with
OL,12,Fplenty of warm sunny spells. Sunshine
OL,13,Fwill turn a little hazy at times
OL,14,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,17,Fwarm or very warm period with a good
OL,18,Fdeal of dry and bright weather. Dry on
OL,19,FTuesday. Just the risk of a few
OL,20,Fshowers on Wednesday and Thursday.
